An exception while processing one order aborted the whole outage recovery run, so the remaining orders
(including paid pending_payment ones) were never checked and could be cancelled by Magento's pending
order cleanup. Collect per-order errors (also \Error such as TypeError), continue with the next order
and report all failures in one CronException at the end of the run.

